; Bob leaks, then Alice pays; flag stays false. "alice MUST pay OR
; bob MUST_NOT leak" is violated at entry 1, although the whole trace is a run
; of its first branch with the outcome Done. The sequences reach their
; prohibition only when Alice pays, after the leak, and stay OPEN. The second
; term is completed by the payment at entry 2.
(scenario readings_leak_then_pay
  (spec "examples/core/core_readings.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (flag (bool false))))
  (entry "2026-06-01T01:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data (flag (bool false))))
  (entry "2026-06-01T02:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data (flag (bool false)))))
